          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant must be a permanent resident of Rajasthan.\n1. The applicant must belong to a small and marginal farmer family. \n1. The minimum age requirement is:\n\n\n\n  - 55 years or above for women.\n  - 58 years or above for men.\n\n\n<br>\n\n**NOTE:** Small and marginal farmer as per the definition under the National Food Security Ordinance, 2013, and as per the Rajasthan Government&#39;s Food and Civil Supplies Department circular dated 31.8.2013.\n<br>\n\n"
        },
